      "statement": "BasePrepareRunMiddleware fingerprints the middleware class, latest message, and preparation configuration, checkpointing a run_prepared_for latch that skips a matching resumed invocation. Preparation must be idempotent because failure before checkpointing can invoke it again, and the middleware prepends the rendered prepared system prompt to the model request.",
